---
description: Tailwind CSS guidelines for responsive design and consistent styling.
globs: /resources/css/**/*.css
---
- Utilize Tailwind's utility classes for responsive design.
- Implement a consistent color scheme and typography with `@theme` in `resources/css/app.css` after `@import "tailwindcss"`.
- Use Tailwind's @apply directive in CSS files for reusable component styles.
- Tailwind scans project Blade and JavaScript files on its own. In `resources/css/app.css`, add `@source` only for paths outside that scan: the pagination templates under `vendor` and the compiled views under `storage`.